[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR001
TITLE: Record of the TLC run and the Common Test run
STATEMENT: >>>
The test report shall record the commands that were actually run and the results they printed. On 2026-11-20, from the repository root, rebar3 as test ct reported All 15 tests passed, covering atc_config_SUITE, atc_clearance_SUITE, and atc_cluster_SUITE, and the last of those calls prop_clearance:quickcheck/0 with 40 cases. make tla-check reported no error on AtcTower, with 414 distinct states and depth 8. make run printed airport KEXAMPLE ready on 1 computers. The PropEr result is conformance evidence and is not a proof. Acceptance is this record matching those commands and results.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The report is written after the run, so the numbers are observations rather than a plan.
<<<
DAL: C
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Plan
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: TLC covers the finite instance only. PropEr samples the Erlang state machine and does not prove refinement. No certification authority approval is claimed.
